  "project_description": "This module is an extension of the datetime_range module and provides an additional field setting \"Until now\".\n\nIf activated this adds a third value (next to \"value\" and \"end_value\") \"until_now\" to the \"daterange\" FieldType.\n\nThe module also provides a FieldWidget which makes the \"end_value\" not required if the \"Until now\" field setting is active.\n\nAdditionally, the provided FieldFormatter outputs the field in a format like this:\n\n01.01.2022 - Until now",
